# Style Guide & Design System — DonateNow

> Reference: [PRD.mdc](../PRD.mdc) | [Frontend Persona](../persona/frontend_persona.mdc) | [architecture.mdc](./architecture.mdc)

---

## 1. Brand Identity

### Mission
Empowering communities through transparent, easy-to-use digital donations.

### Brand Personality
- Trustworthy
- Warm
- Simple
- Transparent

### Logo
- NGO logo placeholder (provided by organization)
- Fallback: Text-based "DonateNow" with heart icon ❤️

