## 3. Typography

### Font Family
- **Primary**: `'Inter', sans-serif` (Google Fonts)
- **Fallback**: `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif`

### Type Scale
| Element | Size | Weight | Line Height | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| H1 | 36px / 2.25rem | 800 (ExtraBold) | 1.2 | Page titles |
| H2 | 30px / 1.875rem | 700 (Bold) | 1.3 | Section headings |
| H3 | 24px / 1.5rem | 600 (SemiBold) | 1.4 | Card titles |
| H4 | 20px / 1.25rem | 600 (SemiBold) | 1.4 | Sub-sections |
| Body | 16px / 1rem | 400 (Regular) | 1.6 | Paragraphs |
| Body Small | 14px / 0.875rem | 400 (Regular) | 1.5 | Labels, captions |
| Caption | 12px / 0.75rem | 500 (Medium) | 1.4 | Timestamps, metadata |
| Amount Display | 48px / 3rem | 800 (ExtraBold) | 1.1 | Donation amount display |

