## 6. Layout & Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Width | Layout |
|---|---|---|
| Mobile | < 640px | Single column, full-width cards |
| Tablet | 640px – 1024px | 2-column grid where applicable |
| Desktop | > 1024px | Centered container (max-width: 1200px) |

### Page Layouts
```
Donation Page:
  - Centered container, max-width 720px
  - Cause card top, donation form below
  - Mobile: Stack vertically

Thank-You Page:
  - Centered container, max-width 560px
  - Success icon + message + summary

Admin Panel:
  - Sidebar (240px) + Main content
  - Mobile: Sidebar hidden, hamburger menu
  - Main content: max-width 1200px
```

