## 8. Animations & Transitions

| Element | Animation | Duration | Easing |
|---|---|---|---|
| Button hover | Background color change | 200ms | ease |
| Button click | Scale to 0.98 | 100ms | ease-out |
| Card hover | Shadow increase | 200ms | ease |
| Page transitions | Fade in | 300ms | ease-in-out |
| Amount button select | Border + background | 150ms | ease |
| Success checkmark | Scale from 0 to 1 | 500ms | spring |
| Loading spinner | Rotate 360° | 1000ms | linear, infinite |
| Toast notification | Slide in from top | 300ms | ease-out |

